  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость с пакетом текстур Bundle Texture Pack <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Interfaces - Неофициальная поддержка модов</a></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zW0OkthM/e9f003365e0bd2251993b6ae30bfca6ae2d6c56a.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces - Неофициальная поддержка модов\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Другие частичные совместимости:</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-curios-api-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_abbc37df-dab3-456d-8af4-12acb6e98bea.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces - Поддержка мода Curios API\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-trinkets-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_725e17b5-3d84-444c-b3f7-7fdf64f8b436.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces - Поддержка мода Trinkets\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-cosmetic-armor-reworked-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_35671bdb-dd62-4da0-a6a6-d4433b1e3f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/descripti